  "processing": "Recorded sources only. Bird recording filtered 280\u20137500 Hz and looped to 28s with a 2s wrap crossfade; wind seconds20\u201380 filtered 220\u20134200 Hz and looped to58s. Bird and wind intermediates level-matched to0.09/0.08 RMS with0.8 peak cap. Day mixes birds with wind at0.45 gain and wraps to58s; night uses wind alone. River seconds30\u201390 filtered85\u20135200 Hz, converted to mono for positional panning and wrapped to58s. Final day/night/river RMS targets0.10/0.08/0.14, all peak-capped at0.8. All outputs PCM16 22050Hz; no synthesized audio. Reproducible recipe in evidence mix_audio.py.",
